{"id":71390822526000,"name":"[🌋UPD] +1 double jump for Brainrots!","desc":"Welcome to +1 Double Jump for Brainrots! 🚀🧠\n\nJump higher, go farther, and collect as many Brainrots as you can! Use your growing double jumps to reach insane heights and discover new areas! 🌌\n\nHow to play:\n🦘 Double jump your way across each area\n🧠 Collect Brainrots to earn Cash\n⚡ Gain +1 Double Jump every time you progress\n💵 Upgrade your Brainrots to boost your income\n🏗️ Expand your base to unlock more storage slots\n🌍 Explore higher zones with stronger jumps\n\nBe careful not to fall… or you’ll have to try again! 😱\n\n💤 Your Brainrots generate Cash even while OFFLINE!\n\nRebirth to multiply your cash! ♻️\n\n👍 Like the game and join the group for FREE OP Brainrots!","path":"/game/71390822526000-upd-1-double-jump-for-brainrots","slug":"71390822526000-upd-1-double-jump-for-brainrots","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/e4b6b06a19bc54a3c54c23a16def16b3520eb12a71a41e9e76529a6703d35059.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-000e7bfc7f345a3cb10adbd0d810ff41/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":6,"visitor":20003900,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-04-06T15:01:09.140Z","creator":{"name":"Copy And Paste Games.","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"+1-double-jump-for-Brainrots!-basic-*-script-192874","_id":"69d3cab5c5616c48d5bbe410","title":"basic ah script","game":{"_id":"69c85f06a467454cb2324b03","gameId":71390822526000,"name":"[🌋UPD] +1 double jump for Brainrots!","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":71390822526000},"features":"base tp\n\nmax area tp","tags":[],"script":"--// Epic Slop GUI\n-- Place this in a LocalScript inside StarterPlayerScripts or StarterGui\n\n-- Create ScreenGui\nlocal gui = Instance.new(\"ScreenGui\")\ngui.Name = \"EpicSlopGUI\"\ngui.ResetOnSpawn = false\ngui.Parent = game.Players.LocalPlayer:WaitForChild(\"PlayerGui\")\n\n-- Main Frame\nlocal frame = Instance.new(\"Frame\")\nframe.Size = UDim2.new(0, 200, 0, 120)\nframe.Position = UDim2.new(0.05, 0, 0.3, 0)\nframe.BackgroundColor3 = Color3.fromRGB(40, 40, 40)\nframe.BorderSizePixel = 2\nframe.Parent = gui\n\n-- Title\nlocal title = Instance.new(\"TextLabel\")\ntitle.Size = UDim2.new(1, 0, 0, 30)\ntitle.BackgroundColor3 = Color3.fromRGB(25, 25, 25)\ntitle.Text = \"Epic Slop GUI\"\ntitle.TextColor3 = Color3.fromRGB(255, 255, 255)\ntitle.Font = Enum.Font.GothamBold\ntitle.TextSize = 18\ntitle.Parent = frame\n\n-- Button creator function\nlocal function createButton(text, order)\n    local btn = Instance.new(\"TextButton\")\n    btn.Size = UDim2.new(1, -10, 0, 35)\n    btn.Position = UDim2.new(0, 5, 0, 35 + (order * 40))\n    btn.BackgroundColor3 = Color3.fromRGB(60, 60, 60)\n    btn.TextColor3 = Color3.fromRGB(255, 255, 255)\n    btn.Font = Enum.Font.Gotham\n    btn.TextSize = 16\n    btn.Text = text\n    btn.Parent = frame\n    return btn\nend\n\n-- Buttons\nlocal baseBtn = createButton(\"Base\", 0)\nlocal maxBtn = createButton(\"Max Area\", 1)\n\n-- Teleport function\nlocal function tpTo(x, y, z)\n    local char = game.Players.LocalPlayer.Character\n    if char and char:FindFirstChild(\"HumanoidRootPart\") then\n        char.HumanoidRootPart.CFrame = CFrame.new(x, y, z)\n    end\nend\n\n-- Button actions\nbaseBtn.MouseButton1Click:Connect(function()\n    tpTo(0, 3, 8)\nend)\n\nmaxBtn.MouseButton1Click:Connect(function()\n    tpTo(-2, 3, 5429)\nend)","owner":{"_id":"69757ec86fe269b3ef2ef5c3","username":"fleurjaune1801","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-profile.webp","original":null},"status":"offline","id":"69757ec86fe269b3ef2ef5c3","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"verified":false,"views"